general population.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Prove that each unit in an SRS of size <m>n</m> from <m>N</m> units has
inclusion probability</p>

<p>
<md>n/N.</md>
</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Derive the probability that two specified population units are both
included in an SRS of size <m>n</m>.</p>
</statement>
