total.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Derive a stratified estimator of the population mean:</p>

<p>
<md>\overline{y}_{st}
=
\sum_{h=1}^{H}
\frac{N_h}{N}
\overline{y}_h.</md>
</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
<p>Explain why stratification can reduce variance when within-stratum
variation is small.</p>
</statement>
</exercise>

<exercise>
<statement>
